<v Richard Hyde>I don't care.
<v Richard Hyde>被告——我不在乎。

00:25:31.220 --> 00:25:38.650
<v Richard Hyde>I know you don't, and I sentence you to 20 days for that. And if you say anything else, I'm going to add 20 days for everything you say.
<v Richard Hyde>法官——我知道你不在乎，我判你20天监禁。如果你再说任何话，你每说一句我就加20天。

00:25:38.650 --> 00:25:40.960
<v Richard Hyde>The defendant-- fuck you.
<v Richard Hyde>被告——去你妈的。

00:25:40.960 --> 00:25:43.140
<v Richard Hyde>The judge-- 40 days.
<v Richard Hyde>法官——40天。

00:25:43.140 --> 00:25:46.190
<v Richard Hyde>The defendant-- fuck you, again.
<v Richard Hyde>被告——去你妈的，再来一遍。

00:25:46.190 --> 00:25:47.690
<v Richard Hyde>60 days.
<v Richard Hyde>法官——60天。

00:25:47.690 --> 00:25:49.530
<v Richard Hyde>The defendant-- go fuck yourself.
<v Richard Hyde>被告——去你妈的。

00:25:49.530 --> 00:25:51.000
<v Richard Hyde>The judge-- a year.
<v Richard Hyde>法官——一年。

