<v Dave Kestenbaum>Which is to give the legislature power over more seats?
<v Dave Kestenbaum>也就是给立法机构对更多席位的权力？

00:43:46.410 --> 00:44:01.710
<v Wendall Willard>Give the legislature the right to make necessary changes. You know, the legislature is made up of the people who elect them. We're not some animal out here, and we create other agencies and bodies all the time.
